Error [E2201]: `jet dev` can't interpret this program yet — it uses an OS fact or process control call
  --> tests/ui/env_config_decode_error.jet:11:19
    |
 11 |     failed :: env.decode<Settings>(prefix: "APP_", file: "", allow: ["APP_PORT"])
    |                   ^^^^^^
 Why: `jet dev` runs your program in a built-in interpreter for instant feedback, but that interpreter doesn't cover every feature; this one needs the real native build
 Fix: run `jet build` then the binary, or `jet run <file>` to compile and run it; `jet dev` will keep showing checks live
